soNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;872.071&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="border: none; border-bottom: solid #D9D9D9 1.0pt; height: 12.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 16.76%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;111.957&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 12.6pt"&gt;&lt;td style="border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 12.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 35.44%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;Total costo de venta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #767171; border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 12.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 16.32%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: white"&gt;1.326.392.828&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #767171; border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 12.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 17.06%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: white"&gt;1.218.115.771&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #767171; border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 12.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 14.42%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: white"&gt;660.708.701&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style="background: #767171; border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 12.6pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 16.76%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: white"&gt;595.956.581&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 7.1pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Los costos consolidados reflejan un aumento de $108.277.057, es decir un 9% adicional frente a junio de 2020. Los costos de Colombia crecieron un 13% por las mayores compras de energía y costos de peajes del comercializador (incremento en la demanda), así como, el aumento del CERE por la mayor generación y tasa representativa del mercado. En Centroamérica los costos de ventas presentan una disminución de USD 7 millones frente a 2020, principalmente por el menor consumo de carbón debido a la declaración de indisponibilidad de BLM del sistema y, a las menores compras de energía dada la mayor generación de las hídricas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ifrs:DisclosureOfCostOfSalesExplanatory>
  <ifrs:DisclosureOfOtherOperatingIncomeExpenseExplanatory contextRef="p3">&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt; page-break-after: avoid; text-align: justify"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: #EE7402; text-transform: uppercase"&gt;NOTA 16. otros ingresos (gastos), neto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;Al 30 de junio, el saldo de otros ingresos (gastos), comprendía:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div style="text-align: center"&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100.0%"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 12.95pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 41.3%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: #5A5A5A"&gt;Acumulado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" style="height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span 