;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: white"&gt;(1.765.813)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="background: #767171; border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 13.7pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 14.0%"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: right"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: white"&gt;13.504.360&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 12.95pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="border: none; height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 41.3%"/&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="border: none; height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 16.72%"/&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="border: none; height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 14.7%"/&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="border: none; height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 13.28%"/&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="border: none; height: 12.95pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 14.0%"/&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/tbody&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst" style="line-height: 11.0pt; margin-bottom: 4.0pt; margin-left: 32.2pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase"&gt;(1)&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;En 2020 corresponde a ajuste a la utilidad por la venta de Zona Franca Celsia en septiembre de 2019 y algunos activos asociados a la operación de dicha inversión&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle" style="line-height: 11.0pt; margin-bottom: 4.0pt; margin-left: 32.2pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase"&gt;(2)&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Incluye principalmente donaciones realizadas a la Fundación Grupo Argos por $5.000.000 (2020 - $4.600.000); Fundación Celsia Colombia por $6.588.000 (2020 - $7.400.000) y Corporación Antioquia Presente (2020 - $550.000)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast" style="line-height: 11.0pt; margin-bottom: 4.0pt; margin-left: 32.2pt; margin-right: 0cm; margin-top: 0cm; text-indent: -18.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; text-transform: uppercase"&gt;(3)&lt;span style="font: 7.0pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;"&gt;  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Incluye gastos no deducibles, multas y sanciones, gastos legales, impuestos asumidos, y el reconocimiento de indemnizaciones de personal en Centroamérica.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Los otros gastos aumentan $747.971 debido a que incluyen los gastos legales y de impuesto de registro por la fusión por absorción de Celsia Tolima&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 11.0pt; margin-bottom: 4.0pt"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: red; text-transform: uppercase"&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ifrs:DisclosureOfOtherOperatingIncomeExpenseExplanatory>
  <ifrs:DisclosureOfGeneralAndAdministrativeExpenseExplanatory contextRef="p3">&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt; page-break-after: avoid"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: #EE7402"&gt;NOTA 17. GASTOS DE ADMINISTRACIÓN&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 4.0pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif"&gt;Los gastos de administración al 30 de junio comprendían:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;table class="MsoNormalTable" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="98%" style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 98.66%"&gt;&lt;tbody&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 11.35pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="height: 11.35pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 47.9%"/&gt;&lt;td colspan="2" valign="bottom" style="height: 11.35pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;Acumulado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td colspan="3" valign="bottom" style="height: 11.35pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap"&gt;&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: normal; margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center"&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;quot;Arial&amp;quot;,sans-serif; color: black"&gt;Trimestre&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;tr style="height: 11.35pt"&gt;&lt;td valign="bottom" style="border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 11.35pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 47.9%"/&gt;&lt;td style="background: #EE7402; border: none; border-bottom: solid #EE7402 3.0pt; height: 11.35pt; padding: 0cm 3.5pt 0cm 3.5pt; white-space: nowrap; width: 12.46%"&